<title>VENEZUELA: Corp Ind Carabobo Q1 net drops.</title>
<headline>Corp Ind Carabobo Q1 net drops.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net profit 1.1 bln bolivars vs 23.1 bln bolivars</p>
<p>Revenues from sale of shares 0 vs 24.5 bln bolivars</p>
<p>Total revenues 1.2 bln bolivars vs 27.0 bln</p>
<p>Total costs 66.0 million bolivars vs 3.6 bln bolivars</p>
<p>Notes: Venezuela's Corporacion Industrial Carabobo SA (CIB) is the holding company for construction company Ceramica Carabobo. The company was previously called Consolidada Carabobo.</p>
<p>Period ends March 31.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
